{"text": "ANCHORPOINT TITLE & SETTLEMENT, LLC\n        4208 Six Forks Road, Suite 910, Raleigh, NC 27609\n              tel 919-555-0115    wires: call to verify, always\n\n                SETTLEMENT STATEMENT (ALTA Settlement Statement - Combined)\n\nFile No.:        APT-26-04417                 Settlement date:   June 30, 2026\nSettlement agent: Joanna Ekwueme, Ekwueme Law Office, PLLC     Disbursement date: 07/01/2026\n                 (NC Bar No. 40217)\n\nBUYERS:    Soren A. Lindholm and Mei-Ling Lindholm, husband and wife\n           currently of 311 Hillsborough Street, Apt 6C, Raleigh, NC 27603\nSELLER:    Bartholomew Trzebiatowski, unmarried (widower), forwarding address\n           c/o Sunrise Villa, 88 Kildaire Farm Rd, Rm 114, Cary, NC 27511\nPROPERTY:  1027 Thistle Brook Court, Wake Forest, NC 27587\n           Lot 14, Block 2, Oakwood Crest Phase II, Map Book 2004, Page 1183, Wake County\n           PIN 1840-67-2291      REID 0318472\nLENDER:    Longleaf Home Lending, Inc., loan no. 4400918273, 30-year fixed at 6.375%\n\n                                                   BUYER DEBIT      BUYER CREDIT     SELLER DEBIT    SELLER CREDIT\nSale Price                                         $468,500.00                                       468,500.00\nEarnest Money (held by Dogwood Realty Partners)                      $7,500.00\nDue diligence fee paid to Seller 5/2/26                         2,000.00         2,000.00\nLoan Amount                                                         $374,800.00\nOrigination (0.5 pt)                                   1,874.00\nAppraisal (POC by Borrower, $625)\nPrepaid Interest 7/1 - 8/1                             $2,029.17\nHomeowner's Insurance Premium, 12 mo.                  $1,611.00\nInitial Escrow deposit                                 $1,947.36\nCounty Taxes 1/1 - 6/30 (183 of 365 days)                               $1,742.08      1,742.08\nHOA Dues proration, Oakwood Crest Homeowners Association, Inc.     $46.00                                                46.00\nOwner's Title Insurance (Reissue Rate)                                                    $1,032.50\nLender's Title Insurance                                 $118.00\nSettlement / Attorney fee                              $1,150.00                         $350.00\nRecording: Deed and Deed of Trust                        $90.00\nExcise Tax (Revenue Stamps)                                                               $937.00\nCommission, Listing 2.5% + Selling 2.5%                                                $23,425.00\nPayoff of Existing Mortgage, Neuse Basin Bank & Trust,\n   acct xxxxxx5530, good through 7/1                                        $141,206.44\nHome Warranty                                                                             $575.00\n                                                   -----------      -----------      -----------     -----------\nTOTALS                                             $477,865.53     $386,042.08     $171,268.02     $468,546.00\n\nCASH DUE FROM BUYERS AT CLOSING:   $91,823.45\nNET PROCEEDS TO SELLER:           $297,277.98\n\nItems Paid Outside Closing: Home Inspection, Carolina Wren Home Inspections, $485.00, paid May 6 by\nMrs. Lindholm on her Visa ending 2171 (receipt in file; she asked about a refund of the radon\nadd-on, $150 - not ours to refund). Survey waived.\n\nDISBURSEMENT NOTES (JE / closer Darnell Uzun)\n1. Buyers' funds: wire of $91,823.45 received 6/29/2026 2:14 pm from the Lindholms' joint account at\n   their credit union, Fed ref 20260629MMQFMP9N004417. Matches Closing Disclosure (TRID three-day timing OK).\n2. Seller proceeds: Mr. Trzebiatowski is in assisted living and signed by attorney-in-fact, his nephew\n   Silas Whitfield-Boyce (POA recorded Deed Book 19644, Page 0871). Proceeds by wire per instructions\n   signed in person:\n        Beneficiary   Bartholomew Trzebiatowski\n        Bank          Neuse Basin Bank & Trust\n        ABA           053744106\n        Account       000418827730\n   Darnell called Silas back at 919.555.0177 (number from the POA, not from the email) and read the\n   account to him before release. Do NOT accept changed instructions by email.\n3. Form 1099-S: gross proceeds $468,500.00 to seller, TIN 104-59-4081 per Form W-9. Bart turned\n   91 in April; Silas says the sale is paying for memory care, so expect questions from the\n   family about the tax.\n4. Soren's name on the loan docs was typed \"Soren A Lindolm\" on the first set; corrected set signed.\n   His SSN on the 4506-C ends 9285; hers ends 1824.\n5. Fannie Mae condo questionnaire not applicable. N.C. Gen. Stat. § 47H does not apply (no option contract).\n\nNotary: Darnell Uzun, Notary Public, Wake County, NC. Commission no. 20211740062. My commission\nExpires March 9, 2027.\nFurther questions: closings@anchorpointtitle.example", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "537 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Joanna Ekwueme", "Soren A. Lindholm", "Mei-Ling Lindholm", "Bartholomew Trzebiatowski", "Darnell Uzun", "Silas Whitfield-Boyce", "Soren A Lindolm"], "companies": ["ANCHORPOINT TITLE & SETTLEMENT, LLC", "Ekwueme Law Office, PLLC", "Longleaf Home Lending, Inc.", "Dogwood Realty Partners", "Sunrise Villa", "Oakwood Crest Homeowners Association, Inc.", "Neuse Basin Bank & Trust", "Carolina Wren Home Inspections", "NC Bar No. 40217", "Reid 0318472", "NC 27603", "NC 27511", "Fed", "Anchorpointtitle"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Raleigh", "NC", "Hillsborough Street", "Wake Forest", "Oakwood Crest Phase II", "Wake County", "Cary", "Sunrise Villa", "Neuse Basin Bank & Trust"], "health": [], "sensitive": ["assisted living", "memory care", "SSN"], "names": ["Joanna", "Darnell", "Silas", "Bartholomew", "Soren"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.10000000149011612, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 0, "detectors": ["e